{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16212390","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16212390","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1621239001:0":{"text":"还真是场热闹的夜游会，不是吗？","source_cn":"还真是场热闹的夜游会，不是吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3DB3D59A10712997","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621239002:0":{"text":"哈梅尔先生，我们是来埋伏偷猎者的，只是没想到……会看到这些。","source_cn":"哈梅尔先生，我们是来埋伏偷猎者的，只是没想到……会看到这些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67383A763DAA6646","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621239003:0":{"text":"呼……夜游会总有落幕的时候，终究会有人被请离舞台。","source_cn":"呼……夜游会总有落幕的时候，终究会有人被请离舞台。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC1002E9DC511808","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621239004:1":{"text":"其实我没打算一直瞒下去，我说过风总会把人吹到他该去的地方。也许从一开始，你们就注定会揭开这一切。","source_cn":"其实我没打算一直瞒下去，我说过风总会把人吹到他该去的地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBEE6E120B05CF43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621239005:1":{"text":"我承认——我确实受雇于偷猎者。那些动物，是准备卖给贵族当宠物的，你们接下来要怎么处理我……我没有异议。","source_cn":"我承认——我确实受雇于偷猎者。那些动物，是准备卖给贵族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF095607B7E28FE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1621239005":{"text":"我承认——我确实受雇于偷猎者。那些动物，是准备卖给贵族当宠物的，你们接下来要怎么处理我……我没有异议。","source_cn":"我承认——我确实受雇于偷猎者。那些动物，是准备卖给贵族当宠物的，你们接下来要怎么处理我……我没有异议。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF095607B7E28FE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621239006:1":{"text":"因为我的确没想过伤害任何生灵。","source_cn":"因为我的确没想过伤害任何生灵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFDBDCAFEBE786B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621239008:0":{"text":"哈梅尔先生……你为什么要这样做呢？","source_cn":"哈梅尔先生……你为什么要这样做呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0B569C7BEE5BC3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621239009:0":{"text":"这一切，都是因为我的懦弱……","source_cn":"这一切，都是因为我的懦弱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x980C503016F30EA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621239010:0":{"text":"从我记事起，我就没见过自己的父母，是在亲戚家流窜长大。","source_cn":"从我记事起，我就没见过自己的父母，是在亲戚家流窜长大。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x007F38F4CD935BDB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621239011:1":{"text":"整个童年都漂泊不定，听得最多的一句话就是：“再哭就把你赶出去！”可每次听见，我反而哭得更厉害了。","source_cn":"整个童年都漂泊不定，听得最多的一句话就是：“再哭就把你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0595ABAA37D10974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1621239012:1":{"text":"对我来说，那些搬家从来不是新的开始，而是一次次被人丢下的过程……不过也能理解，谁会喜欢一个整天哭哭啼啼的孩子呢？","source_cn":"对我来说，那些搬家从来不是新的开始，而是一次次被人丢下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F0297EC139DBE82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1621239013:1":{"text":"有一次我为了逃避搬家，跑进了森林，跑累了就跪在树下，一个人哭得一塌糊涂。","source_cn":"有一次我为了逃避搬家，跑进了森林，跑累了就跪在树下，一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x312E9E39FC600ABD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1621239014:1":{"text":"就在那时，一只松鼠跳上了我的膝盖，静静地看着我，像是能听懂我的心事。","source_cn":"就在那时，一只松鼠跳上了我的膝盖，静静地看着我，像是能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5F025F6F97D291C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1621239015:1":{"text":"那是我第一次觉得，原来连我这样的人，也能被理解，那只小生命就像接住了正在坠落的我。","source_cn":"那是我第一次觉得，原来连我这样的人，也能被理解，那只小...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50AD97E7E600BB0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1621239016:1":{"text":"从那以后，森林成了我的避风港，而我学笛子的原因，也只是为了让更多动物靠近我……","source_cn":"从那以后，森林成了我的避风港，而我学笛子的原因，也只是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x030BA3FB2F024D28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1621239017:0":{"text":"既然如此，你为何要把这些动物交给偷猎者？！","source_cn":"既然如此，你为何要把这些动物交给偷猎者？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC61A9F3CBBE784B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1621239018:0":{"text":"很多坏人都会认为自己是无可奈何的，我也不例外……","source_cn":"很多坏人都会认为自己是无可奈何的，我也不例外……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x12855E9603A14A34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1621239019:1":{"text":"家乡哈姆林镇因森林火灾成立了动物保护协会，我第一时间加入，遇到了志同道合的伙伴，人生因此有了目标和希望。","source_cn":"家乡哈姆林镇因森林火灾成立了动物保护协会，我第一时间加...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AA1F9203D9065FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1621239020:1":{"text":"但镇上承诺的筹备款迟迟未到账，大家都背负了沉重债务，我也不例外。","source_cn":"但镇上承诺的筹备款迟迟未到账，大家都背负了沉重债务，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D385EAB8A268199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1621239021:1":{"text":"伙伴们陆续退出，协会面临解散。","source_cn":"伙伴们陆续退出，协会面临解散。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6ABDD38EF94AD029","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1621239022:1":{"text":"后来，有人找到我，声称愿意资助协会……但条件，是让我帮他们寻找稀有动物，然后将这些动物卖给贵族当宠物。","source_cn":"后来，有人找到我，声称愿意资助协会……但条件，是让我帮...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x008D5404C653870F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1621239023:1":{"text":"我一开始断然拒绝，可他们不断施压，甚至威胁——如果不答应，协会将被强制解散。","source_cn":"我一开始断然拒绝，可他们不断施压，甚至威胁——如果不答...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x36F061856FFEB017","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1621239024:1":{"text":"到那时，我们就无法再继续救助那些虚弱的动物，它们可能会因缺乏援助而丧命。","source_cn":"到那时，我们就无法再继续救助那些虚弱的动物，它们可能会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAFC5EA61A765F1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1621239025:1":{"text":"慢慢地，我意识到——我们根本无力保护所有动物。为了那些可怜动物的生命，我们……最后还是接受了那些人的条件。","source_cn":"慢慢地，我意识到——我们根本无力保护所有动物。为了那些...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB929D818E3A04446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1621239026:1":{"text":"我也开始试着自我说服，我一遍一遍告诉自己，或许它们被贵族收养并非完全